OL,3,GNEWSAWest Midlands floods close theme
OL,4,Apark, bring pub chaos and see people
OL,5,A'lose everything'
OL,6,
OL,7,FBirmingham and Staffordshire affected
OL,8,Fby "significant flooding"
OL,10,FOther parts of the West Midlands also
OL,11,Fdealt with fallout from the weather
OL,13,FFifty-five properties flooded by Perry
OL,14,FBrook, Birmingham City Council said
OL,16,FOne business owner said she had "lost
OL,17,Feverything"
OL,19,FShe described the weather as "ungodly"
OL,21,F"Flood water was a river - I watched it
OL,22,Fcoming round the corner"
